---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Ozzyl Recipes" description="Privacy information for Ozzyl Recipes.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy by design.</h1>
      <p class="section-copy">The current site uses Cloudflare's request-country metadata to prioritise recipes for a visitor's general market. This is country-level network information, not precise GPS location.</p>
      <p class="section-copy">When a visitor manually changes the market, the site stores a first-party cookie named <code>preferred_country</code> for up to one year. The cookie contains only the selected two-letter country code and can be removed through browser settings.</p>
      <p class="section-copy">This initial foundation does not yet collect account information. Before authentication, analytics, advertising, newsletters, or community submissions are enabled, this page will be expanded with production data practices, retention rules, consent controls, and contact information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
